#: docs/architecture.md:6
msgid "Architecture: the demonstrator on the DPI-H RA"
msgstr "架构：DPI-H RA 上的演示项目"

#: docs/architecture.md:44
msgid "each journey's realization of the RA capabilities it exercises."
msgstr "每个旅程对其所运用的 RA 能力的实现。"

#: docs/architecture.md:19
msgid "each of those roles associated with the RA stakeholder it belongs to: the caregiver with Citizens / Care recipients, the clinicians and the community health worker with Health Workers (a role and a stakeholder are different element types, so ArchiMate allows an association, not a specialization);"
msgstr "上述每个角色与其所属的 RA 利益相关方相关联：照护者关联 Citizens / Care recipients（公民 / 照护对象），临床医生和社区卫生工作者关联 Health Workers（卫生工作者）（角色和利益相关方是不同的元素类型，因此 ArchiMate 允许关联关系，而非特化关系）；"

#: docs/architecture.md:54
msgid "Every box in a drawing links to its element's page. <a0>All views and elements</a0>."
msgstr "图中每个方框都链接到其元素的页面。<a0>所有视图和元素</a0>。"

#: docs/architecture.md:49
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every element names its concept in the <a0>glossary</a0> ({code0}), drawn from the same sources as the model, and every role and system names the FHIR {code1} it realizes ({code2})."
msgstr "每个元素都注明其在<a0>术语表</a0>（{code0}）中的概念，术语表与模型取自相同来源；每个角色和系统都注明其所实现的 FHIR {code1}（{code2}）。"

#: docs/architecture.md:46
msgid "Every line is routed orthogonally through the gaps between boxes and never through a box, and ends on a side of its box clear of the box's type label."
msgstr "每条连线都以正交方式穿过方框之间的空隙，从不穿过方框，并终止于方框上不遮挡其类型标签的一侧。"

#: docs/architecture.md:29
msgid "for each country, its own instance of every RA building block its parts play, such as Provider Systems (Thailand) and Provider Systems (Lao PDR): Thailand and Lao PDR are different jurisdictions, so a Thai part realizes Thailand's instance, as the RA draws a concrete system realizing the component it plays (its Table 3.3), and that instance is a specialization of the RA's block;"
msgstr "对每个国家，为其部件所承担的每个 RA 构建块绘制该国自己的实例，例如 Provider Systems (Thailand) 和 Provider Systems (Lao PDR)：泰国和老挝人民民主共和国（Lao PDR）是不同的司法管辖区，因此泰国的部件实现泰国的实例，正如 RA 将一个具体系统画为实现其所承担的组件（其表 3.3），而该实例是 RA 构建块的特化；"

#: docs/architecture.md:87
msgid "How it is made"
msgstr "制作方式"

#: docs/architecture.md:81
msgid "J1 Issue the birth-dose DVCs"
msgstr "J1 签发出生剂次 DVC"

#: docs/architecture.md:82
msgid "J2 Discover and refer the infant"
msgstr "J2 发现并转诊婴儿"

#: docs/architecture.md:83
msgid "J3 Verify, import and schedule"
msgstr "J3 验证、导入并制定接种计划"

#: docs/architecture.md:84
msgid "J4.0 Issue the family's VHLs"
msgstr "J4.0 签发家庭的 VHL"

#: docs/architecture.md:85
msgid "J4.1 Read records at the point of care"
msgstr "J4.1 在医疗服务点读取记录"

#: docs/architecture.md:79
msgid "Journey"
msgstr "旅程"

#: docs/architecture.md:73
msgid "Journeys (use cases)"
msgstr "旅程（用例）"

#: docs/architecture.md:77
msgid "One view per journey"
msgstr "每个旅程一个视图"

#: docs/architecture.md:57
msgid "Systems on the Integrated View"
msgstr "集成视图上的系统"

#: docs/architecture.md:8
msgid "The journeys and systems of this demonstrator, drawn as an ArchiMate overlay on the <a0>DPI-H Reference Architecture</a0>'s own ArchiMate model (smart-ra, version 0.3.0-draft.1). The RA's elements are unchanged and keep their ids, so each RA box here is the element <a1>smart-ra publishes</a1>. The overlay adds:"
msgstr "本演示项目的旅程和系统，以 ArchiMate 叠加图的形式绘制在 <a0>DPI-H 参考架构</a0>自身的 ArchiMate 模型（smart-ra，版本 0.3.0-draft.1）之上。RA 的元素保持不变并保留其 id，因此此处每个 RA 方框都是 <a1>smart-ra 发布的</a1>元素。叠加图新增了："

#: docs/architecture.md:15
msgid "the journeys J1 to J4.1 (the use cases) as business processes, one per <a0>BPMN process</a0>;"
msgstr "旅程 J1 至 J4.1（用例），作为业务流程，每个 <a0>BPMN 流程</a0>对应一个；"

#: docs/architecture.md:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The model is generated, not drawn: {code0} fetches smart-ra's model and its {code1} at the commit in {code2} (sha256 checked), applies {code3}, lays the overlay's views out again with room between the boxes and routes every line orthogonally as Archi bendpoints ({code4}), and writes {code5}. The journeys and their people are read from {code6} and {code7}, and where the countries meet from the BPMN's sequence flows; the systems are the system actors of {code8}, and their parts each actor's {code9} (first drawn as VaxLink's architecture view). {code10} writes the glossary from the same sources. CI fails if the committed model is not what the build makes. The drawings are cat-harness's {code11} subgraph's: no Archi, no Java."
msgstr "该模型是生成的，而非手绘：{code0} 按 {code2} 中的提交获取 smart-ra 的模型及其 {code1}（已校验 sha256），应用 {code3}，重新布局叠加图的各视图并在方框之间留出空间，将每条连线以正交方式布设为 Archi 折点（{code4}），然后写出 {code5}。旅程及其人物读取自 {code6} 和 {code7}，两国交汇之处读取自 BPMN 的顺序流；系统是 {code8} 的系统行动者，其部件是每个行动者的 {code9}（最初绘制为 VaxLink 的架构视图）。{code10} 从相同来源写出术语表。如果已提交的模型与构建结果不一致，CI 将失败。这些图由 cat-harness 的 {code11} 子图绘制：无需 Archi，也无需 Java。"

#: docs/architecture.md:17
msgid "the people who take part, as business roles assigned to the journeys whose BPMN has their lane;"
msgstr "参与的人物，作为业务角色，分配给其 BPMN 中包含其泳道的旅程；"

#: docs/architecture.md:42
msgid "the RA's own building blocks, generic and no country's, in a band of their own below both countries in each journey's view;"
msgstr "RA 自身的构建块，通用且不属于任何国家，在每个旅程的视图中位于两国下方的独立区带中；"

#: docs/architecture.md:24
msgid "the Thai and Lao systems, serving the journeys they take part in, each holding its parts, each part named by what it does (Patient record, Smart forms (SDC), Health workforce registry (CHWs, nurses)); the family's shared phone is a technology device that realizes the wallet app on it, not software;"
msgstr "泰国和老挝的系统，服务于其参与的旅程，每个系统包含其部件，每个部件按其功能命名（Patient record（患者记录）、Smart forms (SDC)（智能表单）、Health workforce registry (CHWs, nurses)（卫生人力登记系统，含 CHW、护士））；家庭共用手机是一个技术设备，它实现其上的钱包应用，而不是软件；"

#: docs/architecture.md:59
msgid "Two columns: Thailand on the left, Lao PDR on the right. In each, the country's systems stack top to bottom in the order of the first journey they serve, each holding its parts, and each part says inside its own box which DPI-H RA building block it plays, as a tag such as «Provider Systems». A system's parts that meet the other country, or GDHCN, sit on the side facing the middle, and each Thai system stands level with the first Lao system it meets, so the dashed lines where the countries meet run across. Between the columns, only what both share: WHO GDHCN and the SMART Trust specifications. The countries' instances of the RA blocks, the parts' realizations of them, and the RA's own blocks are in the model and drawn in each journey's view, which keeps this one narrow and its lines few."
msgstr "分为两栏：左侧为泰国，右侧为 Lao PDR。在每一栏中，该国的系统按其所服务的第一个旅程的顺序自上而下排列，每个系统包含其部件，每个部件在自己的方框内以标签（如 «Provider Systems»）注明其承担的 DPI-H RA 构建块。系统中与另一国或 GDHCN 交汇的部件位于朝向中间的一侧，每个泰国系统与其交汇的第一个老挝系统保持水平对齐，因此两国交汇处的虚线横向贯穿。两栏之间只放置双方共享的内容：WHO GDHCN 和 SMART Trust 规范。各国的 RA 构建块实例、部件对它们的实现以及 RA 自身的构建块都在模型中，并绘制在每个旅程的视图里，从而使本视图保持紧凑、连线较少。"

#: docs/architecture.md:79
msgid "View"
msgstr "视图"

#: docs/architecture.md:40
msgid "what they share, and nothing else, between them: WHO GDHCN and the WHO SMART Trust specifications it realizes;"
msgstr "两国之间只放置它们共享的内容：WHO GDHCN 及其所实现的 WHO SMART Trust 规范；"

#: docs/architecture.md:35
msgid "where the two countries meet, as flow and triggering relationships between their parts, read from the BPMN: the paper DVC that J1 prints and the family carries to J2 and J3; in J4.1, the VHL QR the family's phone shows the Thai clinic, the clinic's signed ITI-YY5 manifest request to the Lao gateway, and the manifest it returns, the access logged in Lao PDR;"
msgstr "两国交汇之处，作为其部件之间的流关系和触发关系，读取自 BPMN：J1 打印、由家人带到 J2 和 J3 的纸质 DVC；在 J4.1 中，家庭手机向泰国诊所出示的 VHL QR 码、诊所向老挝网关发出的已签名 ITI-YY5 清单请求，以及网关返回的清单，该次访问记录在 Lao PDR；"
